Release-record requirements
---------------------------

For every published installer, retain an artifact-specific release manifest
containing the final installer filename, SHA-256, source tag/commit, signing
identity, the staged native-DLL versions and hashes, every bundled model's
source/revision/hash/license, and the generated SBOM/license inventory. If a
required provenance or license item is unavailable, do not publish that
artifact.

This notice is factual release documentation, not legal advice. Distribution
owners remain responsible for verifying upstream terms and satisfying all
applicable license obligations.
